{
  "description": "Hand-built 7-day conversation fixture for Memory benchmark. Each entry becomes one L1 row planted with the given created_at offset (days ago). The `queries` section defines ground-truth retrievals — `expects` lists fixture_keys that SHOULD appear in the top results when querying. The query is graded on recall@5, recall@10, and MRR.",
  "l1": [
