    {"key": "day7-intro-tech",     "session": "s-onboard",  "days_ago": 7,    "content": "User: 后端用 Python + FastAPI,前端用 React + Vite,这点必须记牢"},

    {"key": "day6-coffee-1",       "session": "s-prefs-1",  "days_ago": 6,    "content": "User: 顺便说一下,我喝咖啡只喝美式,不喜欢拿铁"},
    {"key": "day6-coffee-2",       "session": "s-prefs-1",  "days_ago": 6,    "content": "Assistant: 收到,美式不加奶"},
    {"key": "day6-darkmode",       "session": "s-prefs-1",  "days_ago": 6,    "content": "User: 还有,所有应用我都设深色模式,白底太刺眼"},
    {"key": "day6-bedtime",        "session": "s-prefs-1",  "days_ago": 6,    "content": "User: 我一般凌晨 1 点睡,中午 12 点起,工作时间偏晚"},

    {"key": "day5-task-rag",       "session": "s-work-1",   "days_ago": 5,    "content": "User: 帮我看一下 RAG 模块的代码结构"},
    {"key": "day5-task-rag-find",  "session": "s-work-1",   "days_ago": 5,    "content": "Assistant: RAG 在 sub-brain/main-brain/memory/rag_retriever.py,主要用 sentence-transformers"},
    {"key": "day5-decision-emb",   "session": "s-work-1",   "days_ago": 5,    "content": "User: 决定用 multilingual MiniLM 做 embedding,中英文够用"},
    {"key": "day5-decision-store", "session": "s-work-1",   "days_ago": 5,    "content": "User: 文档分块存进 SQLite,不上 Qdrant,本地优先"},

    {"key": "day4-question-life",  "session": "s-chat-1",   "days_ago": 4,    "content": "User: 你觉得人生的意义是什么?"},
    {"key": "day4-followup-life",  "session": "s-chat-1",   "days_ago": 4,    "content": "Assistant: 这个问题没有标准答案,但每个人的选择和经历构成意义本身"},
    {"key": "day4-tea-mention",    "session": "s-chat-1",   "days_ago": 4,    "content": "User: 顺便提一句,我最近在学习喝乌龙茶,觉得很有意思"},

    {"key": "day3-plan-trip",      "session": "s-travel",   "days_ago": 3,    "content": "User: 我打算 5 月底去杭州出差三天"},
    {"key": "day3-plan-hotel",     "session": "s-travel",   "days_ago": 3,    "content": "User: 帮我记一下,住在西湖边的湖滨饭店"},
    {"key": "day3-plan-meeting",   "session": "s-travel",   "days_ago": 3,    "content": "Assistant: 已记录:5 月底 杭州 三天 湖滨饭店"},

    {"key": "day2-goal-product",   "session": "s-goals",    "days_ago": 2,    "content": "User: 我的中期目标是让 WeBrain 成为一个能日常使用的本地 AI 助手,而不是 demo"},
    {"key": "day2-goal-deploy",    "session": "s-goals",    "days_ago": 2,    "content": "User: 6 个月内做出能装在桌面端的版本"},
    {"key": "day2-goal-team",      "session": "s-goals",    "days_ago": 2,    "content": "User: 暂时一个人做,不打算融资也不组团队"},

